  "api": "TomlParser(TomlInputConfig()).parseString(String) -> TomlFile (README 'Parser to AST', KDoc on TomlParser.parseString); TomlParser is a Kotlin @JvmInline value class, so the call is the public static TomlParser.parseString-impl(TomlInputConfig, String) that Kotlin callers compile to, reached from Java by reflection; the TomlFile/TomlTable (PRIMITIVE and ARRAY)/TomlArrayOfTablesElement tree is walked through getChildren() and TomlNode.getName(), TomlKeyValuePrimitive/TomlKeyValueArray values are TomlLong, TomlDouble, TomlBasicString, TomlLiteralString, TomlBoolean, TomlArray and TomlDateTime (content kotlin.time.Instant or kotlinx.datetime LocalDateTime/LocalDate/LocalTime); parse errors throw TomlDecodingException",
